<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\心電図.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Code_of_Honor_#2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\病室夏菜朝.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―April 8, 6 a.m.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\死月編\会いに来たよ閉じ.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I was at the side of <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, asleep under anesthesia.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The morning sun of April 8 crept faintly into the hospital room.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―5 hours earlier, April 8, 1 a.m.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田駅夜外.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Right after that, <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> was rushed to the hospital in <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE>'s car, and the police and ambulances raced to the scene.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The residents, in the middle of fighting back against <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, collapsed and stopped moving.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> died at the scene.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Every one of the residents had a deep gash in the neck, and that was the fatal wound that killed them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">In other words, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> had finished off every one of them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s parents were badly hurt, but neither had a fatal wound.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ワゴン後部座席夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"It hurts! It hurts! </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the way to the hospital, <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> screamed from the agony and thrashed around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Little by little the drug's painkilling effect wore off, and unbearable pain tormented the 10-year-old girl.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I held <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> tight, desperately.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's okay―there's nothing to be scared of.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm right here with you.<PG>
The fresh blood pouring from <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>'s side dyed my clothes deeper and deeper in the color of death.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I knew.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With bleeding like this, there was no hope of her surviving.<PG>
Her breathing grew shallower and shallower, and by the time we reached the hospital, <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> was no longer thrashing, no longer screaming.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still breathing weakly, she was wheeled into the operating room.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手術ランプ暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―April 8, 1:30 a.m.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手術ランプ明るい.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The red light of the operating room came on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I sat motionless in a chair where I could see the light.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, trying to protect us―
{PAUSE ""}
to save us by sacrificing <STYLE ID="1">herself</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
had plunged the Droga into <STYLE ID="1">her own</STYLE> arm without a moment's hesitation.<PG>
Had she been confident she could save us without a scratch?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or had she already meant, back then, to make <STYLE ID="1">herself</STYLE> the sacrifice?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I want to believe it was the former.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> used the Droga out of self-sacrifice―that's just too painful.<PG>
Until the surgery was over, sleep never once came for me, and I simply prayed for a miracle to happen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm someone who doesn't believe in God, or ghosts, or the next life.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But this time, of all times, I wanted to believe God existed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No... 
{PAUSE ""}
it's the opposite.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wanted, with all my heart, to deny that God existed.<PG>
As a trial given to <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, it's far too unfair.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If God is the one giving it... it's far too unfair.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet, in my heart, I kept on praying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it's a trial... if it's a trial, then it can be overcome, can't it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Please, save <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>...!<PG>
Inside my heart, those contradictory prayers and denials swirled together.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―April 8, 5 a.m.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手術ランプ明るい.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手術ランプ暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The operating room light went out, and <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> was brought out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They had operated, but the wound in her belly was deep, and there was no hope she would survive, they said...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Instead of being moved to the ICU, she was moved to a private room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So that we could be at <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>'s side at the end...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\病室夏菜朝.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, here..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What <STYLE ID="8">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> handed me was a handkerchief <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="ぬ">dampened</STYLE> with water.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Wipe your face."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I did as I was told and ran the handkerchief over my face, a red smear came off on it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>'s blood had gotten on my face, it seemed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd been holding <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> in the car, so my clothes were covered in blood too.<PG>
Such terrible bleeding.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My clothes were so <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="ぬ">soaked</STYLE> with blood that it made me wonder how this small body could have held so much.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> was still holding on.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">... get a little rest... You haven't slept at all, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
During <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>'s surgery, <STYLE ID="8">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> had stayed with <STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s injuries were apparently nothing serious, so <STYLE ID="8">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> had come over here as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> was now in the same hospital room as <STYLE ID="10">her parents</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">Erika-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Senpai's mother</STYLE> were being questioned by the police.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you're the one who should rest. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">I... want to stay by </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s side to the very end..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, <STYLE ID="8">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s phone rang.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"It's the police. I'll go take it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> left the hospital room.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\死月編\会いに来たよ閉じ.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I stroked <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>'s pale face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At first, I thought she was a bit of a pest.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that was because of the sadness of not having <STYLE ID="12">her mother</STYLE>, and the loneliness of there being no other kids her age in the Arata settlement―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Being without <STYLE ID="12">her mother</STYLE>, whom everyone had loved, ever since she was born, is probably loneliest at about <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>'s age.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"Mo... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Mo..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>Kana-chan</STYLE> spoke...!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, can you hear me!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I took <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>'s hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And she squeezed back, weakly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\死月編\会いに来たよ半閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\死月編\会いに来たよ.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Eri... nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"That's right! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you made it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... were you... by my side the whole time?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"That's right! I mean, I'm </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s older sister, aren't I!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Thank you... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="12">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I was dreaming she was by my side the whole time... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... you're kind like </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, so... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">that's how I got to have a dream like that."</STYLE><PG>
Did this mean the trial had been overcome?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or was it a mercy God had granted at the very last moment?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, right now it doesn't matter which!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because I'd thought I would never hear <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>'s voice again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if it was a final mercy, I quietly thanked God.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... I'm sorry. For being such an unreliable big sister..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> tried to make some expression in answer to my words, but she didn't seem to have even that much strength left.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How was she taking my words, in that hazy state of mind?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">to the very end... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">was lonely... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But... now... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s with me... so I'm not lonely..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Listen! There are so many places I want to go with you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Motoki-cho has lots of cherry trees, and it's a really beautiful place!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　When you're better... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">when you're better...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Together... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">okay?"</STYLE><PG>
Even as I encouraged her, the tears wouldn't stop falling from my eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm the one encouraging her... 
{PAUSE ""}
so what am I doing crying...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To cover it up, I talked to <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> a lot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> gets better... 
{PAUSE ""}
I told her those <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="はかな">fleeting</STYLE> dreams, whatever came into my head.
{CREATECG "222" "グラフィック\イラスト\死月編\夏菜涙.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
But maybe my feelings had only spun their wheels, because a drop trickled down from <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>'s eye.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why... why is <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> crying too?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because I'm crying?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I won't cry! I won't cry, so...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So just once more... show me a smile...!<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Eri... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\死月編\会いに来たよ半閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
