{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But to conclude from that that <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> was the culprit seems like a bit of a stretch, doesn't it?<PG>
In other words, I suspect that <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE> were hiding something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
