{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She must have been hiding something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, maybe it wasn't only that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I wanted to, I could even form the hypothesis that <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was the real culprit―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
